{"availability":"available","full":"hegsie/WixJsonFileExtension","name":"WixJsonFileExtension","description":"WiX Toolset v4–v7 extension to create, update and remove values in JSON files (appsettings.json) from MSI installers, like util:XmlFile for JSON","category":"Developer tools","language":"C++","stars":11,"forks":0,"created":"2023-08-03T11:06:34Z","updated":"2026-10-02T09:20:39Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://hegsie.github.io/WixJsonFileExtension/","topics":["appsettings","dotnet","installer","json","jsonpath","msi","nuget","windows-installer","wix","wix-extension","wix-toolset"],"demo":"https://hegsie.github.io/WixJsonFileExtension/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T09:03:42.593Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T09:03:42.593Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T09:03:42.593Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T02:36:13.923Z","stars":11,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-10T09:03:42.593Z","stars":11,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Update appsettings.json and other JSON configuration files from a WiX Toolset MSI installer. WixJsonFileExtension adds a JsonFile element that works like util:XmlFile, for JSON: set, read, delete and replace values with JSONPath during install, repair and uninstall, with automatic rollback and no custom action code to write. Supports WiX v4, v5, v6 and v7, and x64, x86 and ARM64 installers.","Windows Installer XML (WiX) is an open-source set of tools to create Windows software installation setups (\\.msi), using XML files to define the content and behavior of the setup.","One important step in most setups is to modify configuration files to reflect either settings specified during the setup by the user, or other settings specific to the individual installation. Windows Installer has built-in actions to modify classic ini-files (\\.ini), and WiX provides extensions to modify XML files, particularly Application Configuration files (\\.exe.config or \\.dll.config) used by Microsoft .NET applications."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/hegsie/WixJsonFileExtension/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"e2855ae114c671de09fe4e293bb637ce72e07820ee3f0cefd17159b3677b3acb","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T02:36:14.074Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T02:36:14.074Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Update appsettings.json and other JSON configuration files from a WiX Toolset MSI installer. WixJsonFileExtension adds a JsonFile element that works like util:XmlFile, for JSON: set, read, delete and replace values with JSONPath during install, repair and uninstall, with automatic rollback and no custom action code to write. Supports WiX v4, v5, v6 and v7, and x64, x86 and ARM64 installers.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/hegsie/WixJsonFileExtension/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"e2855ae114c671de09fe4e293bb637ce72e07820ee3f0cefd17159b3677b3acb","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/hegsie/WixJsonFileExtension/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T02:36:14.075Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-02T09:20:39Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/hegsie/WixJsonFileExtension/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T02:36:14.079Z","hash":"e2855ae114c671de09fe4e293bb637ce72e07820ee3f0cefd17159b3677b3acb","originalBytes":74134,"storedBytes":74134,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["json","file","value","xml","configuration","wix","property","before","path","schema","action","jsonpath","default","elements","files","values","when","uninstall","array","extension","element","net","new","example","installer","operation","package","yes","examples","install","log","operations","appsettings.json","error","using","windows","first","run","see","after","against","elementpath","msi","paths","supported","validation","backup","custom","each","jsonext","like","only","set","setvalue","type","written","any","attribute","build","every","installation","